        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/ac7f955475d3bee09262887807240bb8.avif?t=1765551245\" width=800 height=66 /></span>Carefully plan your route to be as efficient as possible. Avoid backtracking and load your van with delivery order in mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/a683d9ead6845c9b92c9aada8005fc7d.poster.avif?t=1765551245\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/a683d9ead6845c9b92c9aada8005fc7d.webm?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/a683d9ead6845c9b92c9aada8005fc7d.mp4?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/c2379a2d80986b805320527f52503e8a.avif?t=1765551245\" width=800 height=66 /></span>Explore the map during the route or using the practice mode to find secret paths along the way that could help save precious seconds. This could simply be a breakable fence, a ramp or even a fire hydrant used to clear blocks of houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/f5620fbdb25b97be6847f649fd2c8166.poster.avif?t=1765551245\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/f5620fbdb25b97be6847f649fd2c8166.webm?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/f5620fbdb25b97be6847f649fd2c8166.mp4?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/b03ba08fe06fd929ae71bf66fd0fb1b2.avif?t=1765551245\" width=800 height=66 /></span>Time to take your crafted route to the test. Follow through with your plan and adjust it as needed, there's no shame in restarting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/df81eb2229bff865141cfa04978670c0.poster.avif?t=1765551245\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/df81eb2229bff865141cfa04978670c0.webm?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/df81eb2229bff865141cfa04978670c0.mp4?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/2f4286e3d72a7f5cedeaa8a7c340c5ad.avif?t=1765551245\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras_big/2f4286e3d72a7f5cedeaa8a7c340c5ad.avif?t=1765551245 width=800 height=63 /></span>Hone your package throwing skills in the training mode. Explore maps, routes and test strategies. You'll get detailed information about world position and velocities in this mode along with a package follow camera to track your trajectories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/ec5da112333d9d9db2489db6ee81f5a8.poster.avif?t=1765551245\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/ec5da112333d9d9db2489db6ee81f5a8.webm?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/ec5da112333d9d9db2489db6ee81f5a8.mp4?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/e5134636b8b1759df7f4da085d05b92e.avif?t=1765551245\" width=800 height=66 /></span>Compete in online leaderboards. Crush your friends scores or set your sights on the #1 spot in the global rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/2e226b1180698935dd4a8730eee7b73a.poster.avif?t=1765551245\" width=474 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/2e226b1180698935dd4a8730eee7b73a.webm?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/2e226b1180698935dd4a8730eee7b73a.mp4?t=1765551245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
